%p Open these packs:
%ol
  - pool.boosters.each do |count, pack|
    %li
      = "#{count}x"
      = link_to_pack(pack) do
        = pack.name
      = "(#{pack.code.upcase})"
- if pool.playable_promo_cards.present?
  %p You also have access to these playable promos:
  = render "promo_cards", cards: pool.playable_promo_cards
- if pool.unplayable_promo_cards.present?
  %p You also receive these promos, but they're not part of deck construction:
  = render "promo_cards", cards: pool.unplayable_promo_cards
%p
  From cards you open and any number of basic land cards, build a 40 card deck.
%p
  = link_to_sealed_simulator(pool) do
    Open in Sealed simulator
